# #1411: the ip-service push block's address restriction, before
# (d3e61fe3, address only) and after (address and available-from, both
# off print as-value), on a real CHR 7.18.2, 2026-10-01.
# Fixture: ssh restricted to two prefixes, winbox to one, the rest left
# open. Then what get does for each name on this release. Each block once
# at the console with its /tool fetch swapped for :put, then the new
# block saved as a script under the push policy (read,test) and run.
# No token: "tok".

